			"notes": "This is a complete overhaul of the mod and it has been rewritten almost from scratch. Touhou Origins now uses [Voile](https://github.com/Maxmani/voile) under the hood to power its custom origins. There have been many small changes, so please forgive me if I missed something\n\nPlease note that community translations are currently missing from this release.\n\n### Additions\n\n- Added Oarfish, Amanojaku, Nue, Bake-Danuki\n- Reworked Celestial\n- Added the ability to become a _shikigami_\n- **Satori:**\n  - Now has a 25% chance to dodge melee attacks\n  - Added extra information to _Recollection_\n  - Wild animals no longer flee unprovoked\n- **Wolf Tengu:**\n  - Can now sprint while using a shield\n  - Deals damage upon blocking\n- New resource bars\n\n### Changes\n\n- Removed Yuki-Onna, Hell Raven, Kurayami, Tsukumogami (these origins may return at some point)\n- Several powers have been split to avoid bloating them and to allow greater control in what parts of an origin to disable\n- Many powers are now cleaner and written in a more efficient way\n- Power descriptions have been made more concise\n- Miscellaneous adjustments to several origins\n- **Ghost:**\n  - Can now stand on slabs and other half-blocks without triggering _Withering Soul_\n- **Crow Tengu:**\n  - Can now hide their elytra (also cool new texture)\n- **Haniwa:**\n  - Made the resist sound less annoying\n- **Satori (Closed Eye):**\n  - No longer produces sprinting particles when invisible\n  - Combat cooldown now lasts 3 seconds instead of 1\n  - Improved mob behavior\n- **Oni:**\n  - Now spawns in the Nether\n  - _Drunken Stupor_ is now compatible with modded status effects\n- Changed how to close Satori's third eye\n- Improved _Lavish Lifestyle_ mod compatibility\n- Reordered origins to accommodate new and updated ones"
		},
