			"notes": "# Changes\n\n#### Tsukumogami:\n\n- Artisan of animacy has been tweaked. You must now have a certain ingredient item in your offhand to imbue your equipment, in exchange, more powerful enchantments are now possible.\n- Can now enchant horse armor via artisan of animacy (currently only feather falling and thorns)\n- Will now spawn with a smiting book to explain valid ingredient for artisan of animacy. You can also create one by interacting with a smithing table while holding a book.\n\n#### Kurayami:\n- Can now avoid darkness debuff in the Nether with fire protection armor or fire resistance potion buffs.\n\n#### Crow Tengu:\n- \"Heavy\" armor restrictions are more restricted for modded armors, meaning most modded armors can no longer be equipped. If there are any \"light\" armors from other mods that you believe the Crow Tengu should be able to wear, let us know through Github issues or the Discord.\n\n#### Misc:\n- English language files have been updated for Kurayami and Tsukumogami."
